OL,3,GNEWSAStaggering cat had air gun pellet
OL,4,Alodged in neck
OL,5,
OL,6,FA pet cat is recovering after being
OL,7,Fshot with an air gun, prompting an
OL,8,Fappeal to find the perpetrator.
OL,10,FRosie is believed to have been targeted
OL,11,Fnear her home in Whitchurch-on-Thames,
OL,12,FOxfordshire, on the morning of 16
OL,13,FAugust.
OL,15,FAfter appearing in good health at
OL,16,Fbreakfast time, she returned home at
OL,17,Fnoon and was found staggering in her
OL,18,Fback garden in Manor Road.
OL,20,FEmergency x-rays revealed she had been
OL,21,Fshot and a pellet was lodged in her
OL,22,Fneck.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
